      "id": "claim_b84ca73fa9ca440eaddd035980a5842f",
      "statement": "A thread’s durable sandbox binding is `sandbox_id` in live thread metadata, while `SANDBOX_BACKENDS` and `SANDBOX_CONNECTIONS` are worker-local maps; metadata is deliberately never read from queued run configuration, and metadata lookup failures propagate rather than being treated as an unbound thread.",
